 {left}CBArgsAmbivalent msg
⍝ DemoCallbackArgs: report how this ambivalent callback was called.
⍝ Native ⎕WC calls it dyadically when the Event carries an extra array.
 :If 0=⎕NC'left'
     'F1.OUT'eWS'Caption'('ambivalent, monadic: ≢⍵=',(⍕≢msg),' event=',⍕2⊃msg)
 :Else
     'F1.OUT'eWS'Caption'('ambivalent, dyadic: ⍺=',(⍕left),' ≢⍵=',(⍕≢msg),' event=',⍕2⊃msg)
 :EndIf
